unrecognized option: '-x'
Usage: IndexMergeTool [OPTION...] <mergedIndex> <index1> <index2> [index3] ...
Merges source indexes 'index1' .. 'indexN' into 'mergedIndex'

OPTIONS:
 -merge-policy ClassName  specifies MergePolicy class (must be in CLASSPATH).The default is
                          'org.apache.lucene.index.TieredMergePolicy.TieredMergePolicy'
 -max-segments N          force-merge's the index to a maximum of N segments. Default is
                          to execute only the merges according to the merge policy.
 -verbose                 print additional details.

